{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object first. Approach it, grab it if possible. If not found, scan area. Finally, perform task.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject     /> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached     />     <Action ID = GrabObject     />     <SubTree ID = ProcessObject     /> </Sequence> <Sequence>     <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     />     <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> </Sequence> <SubTree ID = PerformTask     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLost     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable     /> <Action ID = GrabObject     /> <Action ID = ApproachObject     />",
